<p>Dear Bob,</p>
<p>I am Aman, a Harvard Business School student. Adarsh (my classmate at HBS) and I have a combined 10+ years of experience in operations, management, manufacturing and supply chain. We've spent the last few years working at frontier AI startups in SF, Boston and India.</p>
<p>As part of a project, we're studying the current challenges in contract food and beverages manufacturing and how AI can help solve them. Among the issues that come up repeatedly in our research is the amount of manual work behind customer documentation, and what a single error in it costs. In Gonnella's case, every one of your facilities goes through an annual SMETA 4-Pillar audit, so the same evidence has to be pulled together again for each customer that asks for its own version, and we would want to know how much of that is still manual today.</p>
<p>We would love to get 30 minutes of your time to deeply understand the problems you're facing today and whether we can help solve them using modern technology.</p>
